-- 0026_trusted_issuers: persisted issuer-key trust set (ANDROID Phase 4 §3B).
--
-- USER-RUN (run on the shared Supabase, like 0011/0013/0014/0015/0016/0018/0025 --
-- never auto-run). Additive + idempotent.
